1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,625
The communicable diseases to know, as pathogen, route and prevention.

2
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:11,458
Tuberculosis, by droplets, prevented by B C G and DOTS treatment.

3
00:00:11,458 --> 00:00:15,156
Typhoid and cholera, from contaminated water.

4
00:00:15,156 --> 00:00:17,317
Hepatitis B, by blood.

5
00:00:17,317 --> 00:00:19,075
Rabies, by an animal bite.

6
00:00:19,075 --> 00:00:24,388
Dengue, carried by the Aedes mosquito, now spreading in Nepal's cities.

7
00:00:24,388 --> 00:00:26,640
Kala azar by the sandfly.

8
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,895
And roundworm, from soil on unwashed food.

